eally thought of everything... Ade, you might actually have what it takes to be a phantom thief.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_122","text":"Heh, it wouldn't be half bad to go soaring across the rooftops with us!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_123","text":"A-a phantom thief...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_124","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_124","text":"Ade looks at me as if asking for help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_125","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_125","text":"He meant more like an agent than a phantom thief.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_126","text":"An agent?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_127","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_127","text":"I-it's nothing at all, Mister Mona...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_128","text":"Instructor, check this out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_129","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_129","text":"Just then, Quency walks over and hands me her phone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_130","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_130","text":"The news is playing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_131","text":"Breaking news.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_132","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_132","text":"We've obtained the first footage of the monster, and we're bringing it to you exclusively.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_133","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_133","text":"As you can see, the monster appears as a shapeless black mass, almost like a shadow—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_134","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_134","text":"... My apologies, we've just received another breaking update.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_135","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_135","text":"Reports of monster sightings are pouring in from across the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_136","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_136","text":"and we're also hearing that an increasing number of unconscious citizens are being found throughout the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_137","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_137","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_138","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_138","text":"We have to do something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_139","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_139","text":"There wasn't anything in our deal about D-Shadows or people losing consciousness, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_140","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_140","text":"Right, we can't just sit back and watch. We'll help you with this too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_141","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_141","text":"Yeah, we can't just sit back and do nothing either!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_142","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_142","text":"I think Leona-san was worried about this too... Teddie, are you with us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_143","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_143","text":"Of course! They gave us a place to stay and kept our bellies full. It's time we repaid the favor!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_144","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_144","text":"I am a weapon created to eliminate Shadows. Even if I am in another world, and even if these are merely beings similar to Shadows, that does not change my purpose.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_145","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_145","text":"I will help resolve this incident.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_146","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_146","text":"Thanks, guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_e_147","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_e_147","text":"Let's get going.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}